Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:16.24,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,All right, missy. Go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.51,0:01:58.03,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\fnArial\shad0.7\fs22\fscx90\b1\bord1.6\fsp0.5\blur0.2\3c&HA95C35&\4c&H744B35&\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(98,318)}Notebook
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.41,0:02:09.28,Default,TAKESHIMA,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.88,0:02:15.19,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,What is this? Seriously, what the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.57,0:02:20.13,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,I-If one of the defenders moves even a bit, \NI'm forced to move as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.13,0:02:21.45,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,Otherwise...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.12,0:02:28.16,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,C-Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.79,0:02:51.52,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,C'mon. If you don't block my view of the goal,\N I'll just take a shot at a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.75,0:02:55.65,Italics,MIYAKO/I,0,0,0,,H-He's so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.01,0:02:58.15,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,A-And he's {\i0}retired?!{\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.42,0:03:03.13,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,I only saw him play once in Futami, \Nbut his ball control is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:06.05,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,N-No, that's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.05,0:03:06.91,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.37,0:03:10.00,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,There's no way playing rope train\N is gonna do anything—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:10.91,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Takeshima.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.78,0:03:15.92,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,The way your pelvis is facing \Nreveals which way you're going to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.61,0:03:18.34,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,And your eyeline gives you away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.97,0:03:20.59,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Try to be craftier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.93,0:03:21.72,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Togashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.22,0:03:25.35,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Attempting to widen \Nyour field of vision is a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.83,0:03:28.33,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Observe Ashito closely \Nand give stuff a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.24,0:03:29.60,Top,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Uh... H-H-Hey. Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.75,0:03:31.10,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Asari. And this goes \Nfor you, too, Takeshima.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.96,0:03:34.97,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Maybe you two should help \NAshito practice defending
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.97,0:03:37.45,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,until you can explain it all\N in simple language.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.22,0:03:41.60,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Tachibana, you're not timing \Nyour eye contact quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.03,0:03:43.05,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Be more decisive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.05,0:03:44.36,Default,TACHIBANA,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.97,0:03:46.18,Default,TACHIBANA,0,0,0,,As for you, Yuma...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.31,0:03:48.67,Default,TACHIBANA,0,0,0,,Keep doing what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.67,0:03:49.37,Default,YUMA,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.71,0:03:52.12,Top,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Old man, listen to me—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.19,0:03:55.55,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Ashito. You're the only one \Nwho let go of the rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.95,0:04:01.28,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,I like to take a walk around here\N on Thursday nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.18,0:04:04.81,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,I'll come train with you \Nat this time every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.28,0:04:08.39,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Keep doing this drill\N until you can do it properly, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.64,0:04:18.65,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.2\b1\fs7.5\fscx90\fay0.02\fnArial\c&H666447&\move(231,150,524,150)}Esperion\N{\fay0.056}Town
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.64,0:04:18.65,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.2\b1\fs7.5\fscx90\fnArial\c&H40442C&\frz345\fax0.3\move(239,299,532,299)}Shuttle Bus Stop
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:18.65,Default,DATE,0,0,0,,Kuroda, in my opinion...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.06,0:04:21.53,Default,DATE,0,0,0,,You are the quintessential\N club youth product.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.21,0:04:23.78,Default,DATE,0,0,0,,That's your defining quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.27,0:04:29.29,Default,KURODA,0,0,0,,Do you mean that\N in a good way or a bad way?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.11,0:04:33.04,Default,KURODA,0,0,0,,Please don't hold back. \NI came to hear all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.66,0:04:37.85,Default,DATE,0,0,0,,I've known you since you were\Non the junior youth team,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.33,0:04:41.80,Default,DATE,0,0,0,,but I've never seen you \Nso openly vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:45.61,Default,DATE,0,0,0,,Very well. I respect your \Ndetermination, so I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.33,0:04:49.06,Default,DATE,0,0,0,,First, let me ask you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.06,0:04:52.96,Default,DATE,0,0,0,,Who seems the least like a club youth \Nproduct on the current Esperion team?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.69,0:04:54.81,Default,KURODA,0,0,0,,That'd be Aoi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:57.66,Default,DATE,0,0,0,,You're right. But there's one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.66,0:04:58.37,Default,KURODA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.37,0:05:03.42,Default,DATE,0,0,0,,When Aoi was selected at the tryouts,\Nto be frank, he wasn't up to our standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:06.57,Default,DATE,0,0,0,,But Fukuda had a different standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:10.70,Flashback,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,It's the same standard that saw Akutsu\Npicked at the tryouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.70,0:05:11.66,Flashback,DATE,0,0,0,,Akutsu?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.26,0:05:17.14,Flashback,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Youth teams tend to get model students\N or elitist players.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:20.08,Flashback,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,The type good at applying theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.08,0:05:25.42,Flashback,DATE,0,0,0,,Right. That's what they lack compared to those \Nof us who took the high school soccer route.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.42,0:05:29.31,Flashback,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Elitism is absolutely useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.31,0:05:31.78,Flashback,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,When you're in a match\N that's life or death,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.78,0:05:34.81,Flashback,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,all it does is make you \Nlose heart quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.61,0:05:37.53,Flashback,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,What we need is some sediment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:42.65,Flashback,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Impurities in the crystal-clear stream\N that is the youth team's environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.06,0:05:46.10,Flashback,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Ashito and Akutsu are alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.10,0:05:50.07,Flashback,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Their chemistry will benefit\N Esperion Youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.92,0:05:56.66,Flashback,KURODA,0,0,0,,Maybe those of us \Npromoted from junior youth
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.66,0:05:59.68,Flashback,KURODA,0,0,0,,do think about soccer \Nbased only on theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.40,0:06:04.43,Flashback,KURODA,0,0,0,,But you're not bound by theories. \NI think I can learn a lot from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.57,0:06:10.78,Default,KURODA,0,0,0,,I had an inkling quite early on about \Nwhat Manager Fukuda expressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:16.26,Default,KURODA,0,0,0,,But it never occurred to me to use it\Nas an opportunity to reflect on my own play.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.69,0:06:20.41,Default,KURODA,0,0,0,,There's no denying that \NI looked down on Aoi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.37,0:06:26.19,Default,KURODA,0,0,0,,It was my stupid elitism holding me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:29.70,Default,DATE,0,0,0,,Ohtomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.15,0:06:33.62,Default,DATE,0,0,0,,Of the first-years, \Nyou are the strongest mentally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.01,0:06:35.20,Default,DATE,0,0,0,,You outshine everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.29,0:06:38.00,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:41.19,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.19,0:06:44.43,Italics,OHTOMO/I,0,0,0,,But I'm always scared stiff before games.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.45,0:06:48.12,Default,DATE,0,0,0,,Have more confidence \Nwhen you're playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.12,0:06:51.43,Default,DATE,0,0,0,,I think you have the \Ntemperament to be captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.93,0:06:52.99,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.09,0:06:58.68,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,M-Manager Fukuda trained with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.10,0:07:01.69,Default,TAKESHIMA,0,0,0,,What a blissful time it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.69,0:07:07.23,Default,ASARI,0,0,0,,And he promised he'd train with us\N like that every Thursday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.23,0:07:11.86,Default,ASARI,0,0,0,,Always thought I had to be established in\Nthe A team to be personally coached by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.86,0:07:15.20,Default,YUMA,0,0,0,,He didn't have anything \Nmeaningful to say to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:20.15,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,I-I'm jealous, of course.\NBut aren't you overworking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.15,0:07:22.96,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,You guys have matches for the B team, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.09,0:07:31.45,Default,TOGASHI,0,0,0,,Yo, Kuroda.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.45,0:07:33.97,Default,TOGASHI,0,0,0,,We're gonna train at night\N startin' tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.31,0:07:37.60,Default,TOGASHI,0,0,0,,We need more attackers, \Nso come train with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.20,0:07:43.56,Flashback,TACHIBANA,0,0,0,,Our regular training won't be enough. \NLet's practice it together now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.56,0:07:44.66,Flashback,TACHIBANA,0,0,0,,Kuroda!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:46.88,Flashback,KURODA,0,0,0,,That's overworking yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.28,0:07:49.24,Default,KURODA,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.24,0:07:55.37,Default,KURODA,0,0,0,,I'll do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.04,0:07:58.54,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Kuroda.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.54,0:08:00.01,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,All righty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:01.79,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\an1\b1\bord0\shad0\fs15\blur0.2\pos(518,292)\c&H0B555A&\frz333}Rustle\NRustle\NRustle
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.33,0:08:01.79,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\an3\b1\bord0\shad0\fs15\blur0.2\c&H0B555A&\frz20\pos(382,198)}Rustle\NRustle
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.81,0:08:01.79,Default,TOGASHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:03.88,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,I discovered something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.68,0:08:08.05,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,0)\bord0\shad0\b1\blur0.2\an8\fnVerdana\fay0.08\fscx85\fax0.2\fs12\c&H364937&\frz27.35\pos(402.85,142.28)}Bathroom
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.68,0:08:08.05,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,0)\bord0\shad0\b1\blur0.2\an8\fs18\fay0.005\fnVerdana\fscx85\fax0.2\c&H364937&\frz27.35\pos(297.72,253.15)}Conference Room
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.68,0:08:08.05,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(260,0)\bord0\shad0\b1\blur0.2\an9\fnVerdana\fscx85\fax0.2\c&H364937&\frz27.35\pos(414,234)}Entrance
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.88,0:08:08.05,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,Forget the window. It's easier \Nto sneak out the unalarmed fire exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.05,0:08:10.35,Default,TAKESHIMA,0,0,0,,A hand-drawn map?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.35,0:08:13.80,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,If we take too many people, \Nwe'll get caught breaking curfew.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.18,0:08:17.83,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,So let's keep it to just us\N for the first week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.83,0:08:18.52,Default,TAKESHIMA,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.02,0:08:22.10,Default,ASARI,0,0,0,,If it goes well, maybe the other \NB team members can join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.32,0:08:36.69,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,W-W-Wait, T-T-Togashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.69,0:08:38.25,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,I'm falling! I'm falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.25,0:08:40.33,Default,TOGASHI,0,0,0,,I'm tellin' you, you're too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.20,0:08:44.29,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,Damn it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.29,0:08:47.46,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,How do you guys react so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.83,0:08:49.17,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.17,0:08:51.09,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,You're all incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.09,0:08:55.59,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,Without using words, you understand\N each other and instantly plug any gaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.33,0:08:59.37,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,I called it "playing rope train," \Nbut this rope exercise...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.86,0:09:03.33,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,makes it obvious who \Ndoesn't have a defensive foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.33,0:09:08.11,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,What an innovative training drill\Ndesigned to single out a weak player.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.01,0:09:15.95,Default,TAKESHIMA,0,0,0,,You idiot, Togashi. \NWhy'd you look away?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.70,0:09:20.30,Default,TOGASHI,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.30,0:09:20.78,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Togashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:22.00,Default,TOGASHI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.00,0:09:24.11,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Um, well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.11,0:09:26.54,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,I don't think you need \Nto scan the field there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.12,0:09:29.44,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,With your current positioning,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.44,0:09:34.30,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,you can already see the ball carrier\Nand the guy you need to mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.79,0:09:37.31,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,So you don't need \Nto force yourself to scan there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.31,0:09:38.78,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,You'll lose one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.74,0:09:44.89,Default,TOGASHI,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.47,0:10:09.02,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what this rope exercise \Nwill do for me, but I'll give it my all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.62,0:10:11.93,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,I won't get left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.01,0:10:15.55,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,All right. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.64,0:10:17.77,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,One more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.11,0:10:19.03,Default,OHTOMO/TACHIBANA/YUMA,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.68,0:10:27.93,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\blur0.2\b1\fs6\fay0.02\bord1.5\pos(464,297)\3c&H5A636A&\c&HA7ABAF&}Tokyo Myosen High School
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.33,0:10:27.93,Default,TEACHER,0,0,0,,So as you can see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:33.69,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\shad0\blur0.2\fs12\fnGeorgia\b1\fscx90\move(168,40,155,40)\c&HBABDA3&}Making sense\N of how he feels
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:33.69,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\shad0\blur0.2\fs12\fnGeorgia\b1\fscx90\c&HBABDA3&\move(264,22.29,251,22.29)}Sanshiro
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:33.69,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\shad0\blur0.2\fs12\fnGeorgia\b1\fscx90\c&HBABDA3&\move(362.86,17.14,349.86,17.14)}Refreshing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:33.69,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\shad0\blur0.2\fs12\fnGeorgia\b1\fscx90\c&HBABDA3&\move(454.29,20,441.29,20)}Mineko
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:33.69,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\shad0\blur0.2\fs10\fnGeorgia\b1\fscx90\c&HBABDA3&\move(517.14,72,504.14,72)}Only these two \Nshare silent moments
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:33.69,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\shad0\blur0.2\fs10\fnGeorgia\b1\fscx90\c&HBABDA3&\move(437.14,174.86,424.14,174.86)}Close yet distant presence
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.34,0:10:34.15,Default,TEACHER,0,0,0,,this is where Sanshiro starts to see \NSatomi Mineko as a romantic interest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:38.95,Default,TEACHER,0,0,0,,To Sanshiro, who has just moved to Tokyo, \NMineko is utterly captivating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:43.45,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord0\shad0\fs6\fax0.5\blur0.2\an8\c&H918C8D&\frz336\move(228,281,228,291)\frx352\fry352}Integrated\h\h\h\h\NJapanese Language
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.95,0:10:40.45,Default,TEACHER,0,0,0,,Whenever Mineko appears,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.45,0:10:45.70,Default,TEACHER,0,0,0,,the vocabulary and grammatical expression\N become especially vibrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:50.08,Top,TEACHER,0,0,0,,Now, let's see... \NMotoki, read the next passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.50,0:10:51.12,Top,YUMA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.20,0:11:06.18,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,The old man's gonna train\N with us today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.44,0:11:08.74,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.74,0:11:10.41,Default,TACHIBANA,0,0,0,,I'm getting nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.55,0:11:14.55,Default,TACHIBANA,0,0,0,,Miyako?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.55,0:11:15.63,Default,TACHIBANA,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.64,0:11:18.19,Default,TACHIBANA,0,0,0,,You're coming here again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.19,0:11:20.01,Italics,MIYAKO/I,0,0,0,,Is that a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.01,0:11:22.62,Italics,MIYAKO/I,0,0,0,,Training at Musashino finished early.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.45,0:11:28.20,Top Italics,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,Oh me, oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:24.50,Default,TACHIBANA,0,0,0,,I-I don't need more underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.50,0:11:26.37,Italics,MIYAKO/I,0,0,0,,I didn't bring any today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.37,0:11:28.20,Italics,MIYAKO/I,0,0,0,,Okay, see you later.
