Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.04,0:11:31.43,Default,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Hi, Anri.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.43,0:11:33.28,Default,ANRI,0,0,0,,You really came.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.28,0:11:34.89,Default,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Well, of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.89,0:11:37.96,Default,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Manager Fukuda's \Ngoing to be coaching today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.41,0:11:42.47,Default,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,I could only join in with their \Ntraining on that first day,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:46.35,Default,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,but I hear Ohtomo-kun and the others\Njoined in and they trained all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.58,0:11:50.18,Default,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,I'm interested to see what \NManager Fukuda is going to teach us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.57,0:11:53.98,Default,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Maybe he'll even give me \Na piece of advice or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.33,0:11:58.48,Default,ANRI,0,0,0,,I don't know about you, \Nbut I think I'll just watch today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.61,0:12:02.24,Default,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.55,0:12:05.14,Default,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Your clothes scream "easy to move around in."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.82,0:12:11.45,Default,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.16,0:12:22.37,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Okay! Your turn, Ohtomo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.37,0:12:23.51,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,All righty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.23,0:12:33.23,Default,KURODA,0,0,0,,Ohtomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.20,0:12:42.98,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Kuroda!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.58,0:12:50.76,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,The rope is taut, Ashito.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.63,0:12:58.57,Top,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.23,0:13:00.96,Default,TOGASHI,0,0,0,,Ashito! Why'd you let\Nthe princess run through?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.56,0:13:07.02,Default,YUMA,0,0,0,,Nice, Anri. I haven't seen you \Nscore a goal since we were little.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.02,0:13:08.57,Default,TAKESHIMA,0,0,0,,The rope was taut.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.57,0:13:10.72,Default,TAKESHIMA,0,0,0,,You let Manager Fukuda lure you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.94,0:13:13.60,Default,TACHIBANA,0,0,0,,But you're really improving, Ashito.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.60,0:13:18.48,Default,YUMA,0,0,0,,Yeah, the synchronization of the \Nfour defenders is way better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.14,0:13:21.06,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,M-Manager Fukuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.06,0:13:23.24,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,This rope exercise is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:27.29,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,I called it "playing rope train," \Nbut it really works.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.29,0:13:31.09,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,If the four of us don't move the\N same way, the rope pulls on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.09,0:13:34.20,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,It teaches my body how to move,\N whether I like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:35.39,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Listen, old man—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.39,0:13:36.98,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Togashi, a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:40.35,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,On your way to school from the dorm,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.35,0:13:43.05,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,you pass several stores with red signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.05,0:13:44.01,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,How many are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.01,0:13:46.74,Default,TOGASHI,0,0,0,,What? R-Red signs?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.74,0:13:48.71,Default,TOGASHI,0,0,0,,Like that ramen place on the corner?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.71,0:13:49.51,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.97,0:13:50.93,Default,TOGASHI,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.70,0:13:54.19,Default,TOGASHI,0,0,0,,Oh, the pharmacy by the river has one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.19,0:13:55.52,Default,TOGASHI,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.21,0:13:57.13,Default,TOGASHI,0,0,0,,Three?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.25,0:13:58.83,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Ashito.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.52,0:14:02.36,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,W-Well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.29,0:14:09.24,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,The DVD rental store.\NThe manga café. The BBQ place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.03,0:14:10.47,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,700)\fnImpact\bord1.2\fsp6\shad0\fax0.12\blur0.2\pos(129,112)\frz354.8\3c&H827287&\c&H4C2F3F&}RENTAL
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.78,0:14:10.04,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,320)\bord1.6\shad0\blur0.2\fnArial Black\fay-0.055\fs18\pos(479,155)\3c&H5DCDFC&\c&H3E3FDB&}Manga\N{\fay-0.04}Café
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:10.04,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,320)\an7\fnGeorgia\b1\blur0.2\fs12.5\fscy140\bord0\shad0\fscx90\fax-0.3\pos(448,214)\c&HEEF0F5&\frz12.63}BBQ Kokuou
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.85,0:14:13.91,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,And the pharmacy sign has red letters,\Nbut it's actually white, Togashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.80,0:14:13.91,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(720,0)\fnArial\fry12\b1\blur0.2\bord0\shad0\fax0.45\fs14\c&H543BD4&\frz337.1\pos(236.5,72)}Myosen
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.80,0:14:13.91,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(720,0)\fnArial\fry12\b1\blur0.2\bord0\shad0\fay-0.04\fax0.47\fs12\c&H543BD4&\frz337.1\pos(265,96)}Drug
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.80,0:14:13.91,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(720,0)\an8\fnArial\b1\shad0\blur0.2\fs11\bord1.1\fax0.2\3c&HACBAB2&\c&H59605C&\frz348\pos(256,223.5)\fry12}Prescriptions
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.86,0:14:18.97,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,And that one. Plus that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.36,0:14:21.42,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:24.42,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.70,0:14:36.01,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,If you're registering a white sign as red,\Nyou've got a long way to go, Togashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.01,0:14:38.44,Default,TOGASHI,0,0,0,,But Fukuda-san, that's a bit, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.86,0:14:42.80,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,For the next 24 hours, note anything\Nand everything you see in detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.41,0:14:45.88,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,I'll ask you another question next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.69,0:14:50.32,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Kuroda, here's my advice for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.32,0:14:51.48,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,I wrote it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.48,0:14:52.65,Default,KURODA,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.96,0:14:53.78,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Tachibana.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.78,0:14:54.20,Default,TACHIBANA,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:56.43,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Oh, and the girl from the ladies' team.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.43,0:14:58.46,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,I wrote down what I noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.46,0:15:01.21,Default,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.57,0:15:02.94,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Takeshima. Asari.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.99,0:15:05.91,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,I can't promote you to the A team yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.91,0:15:09.18,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,but in tomorrow's intrasquad game, \Nwanna play on the squad team?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.18,0:15:10.47,Default,ASARI,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.93,0:15:13.29,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,Oh, so the four of us can play together?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.97,0:15:15.52,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Okay, that's all for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.30,0:15:17.22,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.65,0:15:21.52,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Huh?! H-H-Hold on a second,\N Manager Fukuda!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.52,0:15:24.12,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Wh-What about me?\NDon't I get any advice?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.33,0:15:30.35,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Nope. Nothing in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:34.95,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.95,0:15:39.42,Default,ANRI,0,0,0,,Aoi. I think that's enough\N sports drink now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.42,0:15:42.32,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,How can I {\i1}not{\i0} hit the bottle?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.32,0:15:46.64,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,I was looking forward to his feedback \Nall week while training hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.01,0:15:47.88,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.24,0:15:49.77,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.77,0:15:53.13,Default,ANRI,0,0,0,,You did get wrapped up\Nin your training, Aoi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:56.42,Default,ANRI,0,0,0,,So much so, in fact, \Nthat you're looking a little thinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.42,0:15:58.73,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Huh? Y-You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.38,0:16:03.31,Default,ANRI,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.31,0:16:07.90,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,I guess my food intake was fine, \Nbut I did get less sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.67,0:16:11.90,Default,ANRI,0,0,0,,If you'd like...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.40,0:16:15.35,Default,ANRI,0,0,0,,Do you want me to make lunches for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.89,0:16:17.16,Default,ANRI,0,0,0,,From now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.18,0:16:19.79,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.66,0:16:24.77,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Uh, I can't ask you to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.77,0:16:28.33,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,The daughter of our sponsor \Nhas to do stuff like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.06,0:16:32.65,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Anyway, I have the meal plans\N Hana made for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.65,0:16:35.09,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,They go all the way to July.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.81,0:16:41.93,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Speaking of Hana, \NI haven't really seen her since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.30,0:16:45.15,Default,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Huh? Did you say "Hana"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.15,0:16:49.30,Default,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,On my way here, \NI spotted her at the train station.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:51.82,Default,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,It was just her and Kuribayashi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:53.42,Default,ANRI,0,0,0,,M-Miyako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.42,0:16:55.70,Default,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Anri, you saw her, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.37,0:16:58.53,Default,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Meeting up alone like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.53,0:17:01.29,Default,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Are those two dating?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.45,0:17:07.09,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.54,0:17:10.73,Default,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,K-Kuribayashi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.73,0:17:13.05,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,Aoi, do you have a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.05,0:17:14.68,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.68,0:17:16.71,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,Hana-san asked me to do her a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.09,0:17:20.81,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,I'll give you some advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.98,0:17:36.28,Flashback,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Did you say Hana? I spotted her\Nat the train station with Kuribayashi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.86,0:17:38.97,Flashback,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,Are those two dating?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.63,0:17:43.78,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,Let's see... Advice...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.07,0:17:52.92,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,K-Kuribayashi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:57.40,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to give me \Nadvice all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.40,0:17:59.43,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,And what's Hana's part in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.65,0:18:03.12,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Did you run into her in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.43,0:18:06.99,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,I mean, you two know each other, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.44,0:18:10.69,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,She took care of me once\N when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.43,0:18:15.31,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,She's managing my nutrition\N at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.41,0:18:21.00,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,When I asked her to produce\N a nutrition plan for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.00,0:18:23.35,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,she asked me to give you\N advice in exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.35,0:18:25.37,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Sh-She asked for something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.88,0:18:28.64,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.17,0:18:31.57,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,A soccer notebook. It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.84,0:18:35.79,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,I'm not cut out for coaching\N or giving advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.15,0:18:38.09,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,So you can have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.39,0:18:46.02,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.54,0:18:49.98,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,But this is the notebook you wrote in\Nduring the Kashiwa game.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.29,0:18:52.06,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Isn't it important?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.64,0:18:53.37,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.17,0:18:56.11,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,I memorized the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.39,0:18:58.65,Default,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,N-Not cut out for coaching?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.65,0:19:01.19,Default,MIYAKO,0,0,0,,A player of Kuribayashi-san's\N caliber? No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.19,0:19:05.24,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,Manager Fukuda also said not being able\N to coach others was a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.71,0:19:07.93,Default,ANRI,0,0,0,,No, not in his case.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.93,0:19:11.92,Default,ANRI,0,0,0,,Because he's on a whole other level,\Nno one else can understand him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:17.76,Default,ANRI,0,0,0,,That's why I'm even more curious \Nabout what's in that notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:25.69,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,Why would he give away \Nsomething so important?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.17,0:19:28.97,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,He seems like the type that \Ndoesn't listen to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.02,0:19:32.90,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,So why's he doing what Hana asked?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.47,0:19:35.00,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,What is she to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.63,0:19:39.19,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,Actually, why am I thinking \Nabout something like that {\i0}now{\i1}?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.19,0:19:41.59,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,I've got a mountain of stuff\N I need to work on,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.17,0:19:44.13,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,and I'm aiming to go pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:47.54,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,It's pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.55,0:19:52.73,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,All right. I'm heading off now. \NBut there's one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.77,0:19:58.64,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,I wrote all that in a way\N that made sense to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.43,0:20:01.26,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,Especially the tactical stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:04.53,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,But few people understand it\Nwhen I show them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.02,0:20:17.94,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\q2\bord0\shad0\b1\blur0.2\an7\fs18\c&H292720&\pos(88,45)}With the presence of one ideal full-back,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.02,0:20:17.94,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\q2\bord0\shad0\b1\blur0.2\an7\fs18\c&H292720&\pos(305,71.5)}this situation turns into a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.02,0:20:17.94,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\q2\bord0\shad0\b1\blur0.2\an7\fs12\c&H292720&\pos(65,115)}Superb in attack and defense
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.02,0:20:17.94,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\q2\bord0\shad0\b1\blur0.2\an7\fs18\c&H292720&\pos(67,143.5)}Doesn't meet the conditions. Needs a teammate
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.02,0:20:17.94,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\q2\bord0\shad0\b1\blur0.2\an7\fs18\c&H292720&\pos(67,230)}who can cover the whole left-hand side of the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.88,0:20:45.73,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Kuribayashi-san. Can you really do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.81,0:20:51.49,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,I don't get a lot of chances to talk to you,\N so I want to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.60,0:20:55.17,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,I really want to go pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.26,0:21:01.41,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,And to achieve that, I'm desperately\Ndoing all I can, every single day. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.78,0:21:05.53,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,For you, going pro is inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.56,0:21:08.16,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,You're in a league of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.75,0:21:13.29,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,For a guy like you, \Nwhat's your goal in soccer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.37,0:21:17.13,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,What kind of view do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.32,0:21:28.48,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,You play soccer to get to the pro level?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.48,0:21:29.60,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.60,0:21:31.27,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,At this moment in time...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.47,0:21:36.94,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,Who is the best player in the world, Aoi?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.23,0:21:37.98,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.21,0:21:43.94,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,In every era, if you ask that question\N anywhere in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.32,0:21:46.48,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,a specific player will come to mind, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.52,0:21:52.62,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,I want that player...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.71,0:21:54.95,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,to be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.80,0:22:06.99,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,If you've decided to devote \Nthe only life you get to soccer,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.53,0:22:11.46,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,I don't get why that {\i1}wouldn't{\i0} be your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.84,0:22:16.45,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,But you managed to read it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.77,0:22:20.90,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,That makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.00,0:22:37.50,Default,CREDITS,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\an7\fnArial\b1\fs16\4a&H00&\shad1.5\bord1.2\3c&H2D1718&\4c&H2D1718&\c&HC5969E&\pos(365,20)}Translation: Tomoko Takedani Sater\NTiming: Andy Ellis\NEditing: SMR\NQuality Control: William Haggard\NTranslation Check: David Saylor
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.97,0:24:16.85,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,I'll crush you, you little shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.85,0:24:17.54,Default,TOGASHI,0,0,0,,I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.54,0:24:19.35,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,That's convenient for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.35,0:24:21.85,Default,NAE,0,0,0,,The strongest youth player is in top form.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.00,0:24:22.68,Top,TAKASUGI,0,0,0,,Why are you two so indifferent?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.68,0:24:23.23,Default,TACHIBANA,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.23,0:24:26.02,Top,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,I hope you boys can keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.97,0:24:28.18,Top Italics,ASHITO,0,0,0,,{\pos(460,247.5)}I've got to look up.\NLook up. Look up!
